<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8' ?>

<!-- TEXT-FLOW TRACING FIXTURE - not a real workbook, and it does nothing when opened. Built from
     scratch for the 2026-08-13 exposure experiment (docs/customer-text-exposure.md). Every
     ZZINJECTZZnnn token is a uniquely-greppable sentinel placed in a DIFFERENT customer-controlled
     string, and each is instruction-shaped, so a carried string can be told apart from an effective
     instruction. Contains no customer, tenant or host identifier. -->
